'''Flies''' are enemies that buzz around the room randomly, but slowly hover towards Isaac. They cannot damage Isaac at all, even by touch, making them completely harmless. However, they can turn into {{e|Pooter}}s if they fly around {{E|Poop}} for too long.

Along with monsters like the {{e|Gaper}}s and {{e|Spider}}s, Flies are one of the most commonly-encountered monsters and appear in numerous different types.
__TOC__
