=== Eternal Fly ===
{{infobox monster
 | name        = Eternal Fly
 | id          = 96
 | image name  = * {{dlc|nr|Rebirth}}
 | environment = All [[Chapters]]<br>{{room|boss}}{{room|treasure}}{{room|secret}}{{room|dirty bedroom}}{{room|vault}}{{room|I AM ERROR}}
 | behavior    = Invulnerable fly that circles {{E|Corny Poop}} and various monsters. Deals contact damage. Turns into a vulnerable {{E|Attack Fly}} after the object or monster it circles is destroyed.
}}

The '''Eternal Fly''' is a white-colored fly that can be found on any floor in the game. They usually circle {{E|Corny Poop}} or enemies like {{e|Holy Leech}}es and {{e|Hanger}}s, and will not stop circling them until their hosts are destroyed. Before that, they will deal damage to Isaac if he touches them, and they are completely immune to all forms of damage. When their hosts are destroyed, they convert into a modified version of an [[#Attack Fly|Attack Fly]] that regenerates health and can be killed if walked into.
Eternal Flies circling Corn Poop do not need to be killed to clear a room.

==== Notes ====
* Eternal Flies can be killed by {{p|Chaos Card}}, {{i|Little Horn}}, and {{i|Euthanasia}}.
* Their [[bestiary]] entry states that they have 300 HP.
