'''Hush Flies''' are mainly spawned by {{e|Hush}} and behave somewhat similar to [[Ring Fly|Ring Flies]], but do not fly towards Isaac and remain in a fixed path. Unlike Ring Flies, Hush Flies can form other shapes such as polygons. When spawned by Hush they can also orbit it, form a pattern and travel in a straight path, or form a pattern and chase after Isaac.

Hush Flies have a brief period of invincibility when Hush spawns them, making them appear to have more health than they actually have.

{{dlc|a+}} Hush Flies can also spawn outside of the Hush fight in some rare rooms. When encountered in these rooms they will continuously orbit in a fixed path.

==== Notes ====
* Hush Flies are not affected by the {{tf|Beelzebub}} [[transformation]].
* {{dlc+|r}} They can also appear in {{s|???}} with the use of {{i|Red Key}}.{{dlc-}}
